  "brand_kit_id": "atelier.design.neutral",
  "few_shot_summary": "ApprovalCommandCenter renders a 1280x720 two-pane operational surface: a Queue of approvals on the left, a DetailView with primary Approve + Reassign actions on the right, plus a CommandPalette opened from the chrome and a confirmation Modal overlay for reversible approvals."
